sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant OP as Outbox publisher
    participant PG as PostgreSQL (its schema)
    participant MQ as RabbitMQ
    participant C as Receiving consumer
    OP->>MQ: publish event (MessageId m), confirmed
    MQ->>C: deliver m: applied, Inbox row m
    Note over OP: crash before the row is marked published
    Note over OP,PG: after restart the row is still unpublished
    OP->>MQ: publish the same row again (same MessageId m)
    MQ->>C: deliver m again
    C->>C: Inbox: m already processed
    C-->>MQ: ack as no-op (one business effect)
    OP->>PG: mark the row published
    Note over OP,C: TP-O03 recreates this state (service stopped, row set back to unsent)
